WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
Both tools enter the same keyhole. The copper flag pushes on the bolt tail.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.917
The wire lifts the front lever. Its spring brings it back down as the wire lowers.

00:00:01.917 --> 00:00:02.833
The middle lever moves too. The bolt has stayed in the same place through both lifts.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.667
The wire reaches the rear lever. Its edge is the one bearing on the stump.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.208
The stump enters the rear gate. The wire lowers and the gate stays at the stump.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:08.417
The middle gate now admits the stump. The front lever still holds the bolt.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:10.833
The three gates form a passage through the stack.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.500
The pressure tool draws the bolt inside the faceplate.
